WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:08.390
This is Code Canvas for the web. The library starts empty. Let's import
a local SVG illustration.

2
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:17.390
Fit Window shows the whole canvas. Fit Content focuses on the artwork
without changing the source file.

3
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:26.390
Refresh reloads the preview. Full screen gives the canvas more room.
Exit to return to the workspace.

4
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:36.390
Open Code, change a shape’s color in the SVG, then choose Apply and
Preview to see the result.

5
00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:45.890
On a phone, open the file from the library and pick either fit mode.
Imports stay in this browser.

6
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:55.390
Finally, export the edited source as a backup. The project page links to
both the web and Android apps.
